"moving messages between folders.</p><p><b>maildir:</b> "
"KMail's mail folders are represented by real folders on disk. Individual "
"messages are separate files. This may waste a bit of space on disk, but should "
"be more robust, e.g. when moving messages between folders.</p></qt>"
msgstr ""

#: configuredialog.cpp:4403
